{"id":"funcional.tipos-dominio.posible-o-no","lesson":"funcional.tipos-dominio","kind":"clasificar","level":"semilla","required":true,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"Does it make sense?"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"With the model of four loose values (state, courier, time and reason), all these orders can be written. Place each one according to whether it makes sense or is impossible in reality."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[],"variant":[],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"With loose values, the last two can be written even though they make no sense. With a variant, they cannot: "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Entregado","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" requires the time and "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Cancelado","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" has no place for a courier."}]}],"teachers":[],"evaluation":{"type":"classify","categories":["Makes sense","Is impossible"],"elements":[{"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Delivered, with a time."}],"category":0},{"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancelled, with a reason."}],"category":0},{"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Pending, with no other value."}],"category":0},{"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Delivered, with no time."}],"category":1},{"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancelled, with a courier."}],"category":1}]}}
